# R-282 / R-677 strip plots. Each plot is front house, yard, rear range and
# sometimes a shed; a 2-cell passage every third frontage and a 2-cell yard
# around every outbuilding keep courts open. Plots never cover the Rataskaev
# well court, the knights' court, the Karja approach, the inspection square,
# route bands, anchors, transitions or patrol points.
